"Chef Kabir cooks for the Velras aboard the megayacht Libra."
"He is a C-rank Longsight Brute, a Brute for over twenty years and fast with a knife."
"His spell sets up a short-lived viewpoint, which he uses to watch pots."
"He makes gourmet grilled cheese and Jamaican jerk chicken."
"In the Matadero crisis Galecourse flew him to the cube, where he cooked nonstop for two days."
"After the flood he quit the Velras to cook for an Artonan called Mo-nee, who loves his croutons."
